{"parentUuid":"3e329164-5c87-49f2-940e-c7a48705f3fe","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"1e5f8d6b-600d-482c-818a-f3cca593bcde","agentId":"a37ab2812811a4b37","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017f8rj6WEZZZgE1tJj6DR4X","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"ABB OT40F4 dimensions mm width height depth DIN rail switch disconnector OHYS2AJ OXP6X shaft\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"OT40F4N2 General Information Extended Product Type: OT40F4N2 Product ID:\",\"url\":\"https://www.standardelectricsupply.com/userfiles/ad/documents/ABB_OT40F4N2_Datasheet.pdf\"},{\"title\":\"abb-entrelec ot40 °F4 °C\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/abb-entrelec-ot40-%C2%B0F4-%C2%B0C-ot40-%C2%B0F4-Contacts-Mounting-Profile/dp/B00AMH7A1S\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OT 40A 4 Pole Isolator for Base or DIN Rail Mounting\",\"url\":\"https://www.ilecsys.co.uk/products/abb/ot/ot40f4n2\"},{\"title\":\"OT40F4N2 1SCA104932R1001 ABB\",\"url\":\"https://int.rsdelivers.com/product/abb/ot40f4n2-1sca104932r1001/abb-4-pole-din-rail-isolator-switch-ip20-40a-560/6867275\"},{\"title\":\"1SCA104934R1001 ABB OT40F4C CHANGE-OVER SWITCH Electric Au..\",\"url\":\"https://www.electricautomationnetwork.com/en/abb/ot40f4c-change-over-switch-abb-ot40f4c-1sca104934r1001\"},{\"title\":\"ABB ot40f4c 40amp 4 pole change-over switch\",\"url\":\"https://www.ledcontrols.co.uk/abb-ot40f4c-40amp-4-pole-change-over-switch-ot40f4c.html\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OT40F4N2 (1SCA104932R1001) Switch-Disconnector\",\"url\":\"https://rig-well.com/product/abb-ot40f4n2-1sca104932r1001-switch-disconnector/\"},{\"title\":\"OT40F4C Abb Ot40f4c Change-Over Switch - Santa Clara Systems\",\"url\":\"https://www.santaclarasystems.com/abb/ot40f4c\"},{\"title\":\"ABB 4 Pole DIN Rail Non Fused Isolator Switch - 40 A Maximum Current\",\"url\":\"https://www.enrgtech.co.uk/product/isolator-switches/ET21674897/OT40F4C--1SCA104934R1001\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OT40F4C Change-Over Switch\",\"url\":\"https://www.indtrd.com/products/abb/ot40f4c/85832\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, I found dimension information for ABB OT40F4 switch disconnectors. Here are the specifications:\n\n**ABB OT40F4N2 (4-pole, DIN rail switch disconnector):**\nWidth: 48 mm, Height: 56 mm, Depth/Length: 68 mm\n\n**ABB OT40F4C (4-pole, change-over switch):**\nDimensions (H × W × D): 68 × 96 × 68 mm\n\nBoth models are 4-pole, front operated, base mounted, DIN-rail mountable switch-disconnects.\n\nThe search results provided information on the standard OT40F4 models but did not include specific details about the optional part numbers you mentioned (OHYS2AJ, OXP6X shaft). For those specific accessories and their dimensions, you may need to consult the complete ABB product documentation or contact ABB directly.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"9c8167e7-7c4c-4a03-862f-55173056615d","timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:02:49.235Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"3e329164-5c87-49f2-940e-c7a48705f3fe","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE\\AUTOKITCH_COORDINATION\\worktrees\\claude-hat3-v8","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
