{"parentUuid":"1151e1b0-d1bd-4661-85a2-e01de9302c8e","isSidechain":true,"promptId":"1e5f8d6b-600d-482c-818a-f3cca593bcde","agentId":"a37ab2812811a4b37","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01F39ey4uwTPedqecq5m9Ujb","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"ABB OHYS2AJ handle dimensions OXP6X shaft 6mm length OT16-OT125 door mounted\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"ABB OXP6X290 Pistol Handle Shaft, 6 x 290 mm: Amazon.com: Tools & Home Improvement\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/ABB-OXP6X290-Pistol-Handle-Shaft/dp/B00JV3JRSS\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OXP6X500 Operating Shaft, For Use With OT160-250 Disconnector Switches: Amazon.com: Industrial & Scientific\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/ABB-OXP6X500-Operating-OT160-250-Disconnector/dp/B01DL6R5YI\"},{\"title\":\"ABB IP65 Handle For Base Mount Isolators OHYS2AJ\",\"url\":\"https://www.expertelectrical.co.uk/abb-ohys2aj\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OHYS2AJ IP65 Red/Yellow Defeatable Handle OT16-OT125F switches - Edwardes\",\"url\":\"https://www.edwardes.co.uk/products/abb-ohys2aj-ip65-red-yellow-defeatable-handle-ot16-ot125f-switches\"},{\"title\":\"OHYS2AJ ABB OT Red/Yellow IP65 Defeatable Handle\",\"url\":\"https://www.ilecsys.co.uk/abb/ot/ohys2aj\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OT 330mm x 6mm Shaft for OT16 - OT125 Isolators and for Square Selector Style Handle\",\"url\":\"https://www.ilecsys.co.uk/abb/ot/oxs6x330\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OHYS2AJ Selector Handle, Yellow : Industrial & Scientific\",\"url\":\"https://www.amazon.com/ABB-OHYS2AJ-Selector-Handle-Yellow/dp/B00JV3CH44\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OHYS2AJ Handle\",\"url\":\"https://www.mrosupply.com/electrical/6151800_ohys2aj_abb/\"},{\"title\":\"ABB OHYS2AJ Selector Handle\",\"url\":\"https://www.standardelectricsupply.com/ABB-OHYS2AJ-Selector-Handle\"},{\"title\":\"OHYS2AJ ABB Industrial Accessories, OHY Series\",\"url\":\"https://www.galco.com/ohys2aj-abbg.html\"}]\n\nBased on the search results, here's the information I found about the ABB OHYS2AJ handle with OXP6X shaft specifications:\n\n**Handle Dimensions:**\nThe OHYS2AJ handle dimensions are 65 x 65 x 48mm\n\n**Shaft Specifications:**\n- For shaft diameter 6 mm, door drilling 22.5 mm\n- An extension shaft is required for this type of handle\n\n**Compatibility:**\nThis is an IP 65 handle suitable for OT16 through to OT125F switches, with red-yellow color, padlockable, defeatable, NEMA 1, 3R, 12\n\n**Additional Features:**\n- The handle provides Indication I-O and ON-OFF\n- It is padlockable with max 3 padlocks with bail diameter 5...8 mm, with door interlock in ON position\n\nThe search results confirm this is designed for base mount isolators with the OXP6X shaft system for the OT16-OT125 range.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"uuid":"528904c9-bca0-4e99-b32a-632e968a0925","timestamp":"2026-10-03T19:03:01.134Z","sourceToolAssistantUUID":"1151e1b0-d1bd-4661-85a2-e01de9302c8e","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"C:\\Users\\Kemal\\Desktop\\Kemal\\WEBSİTE\\AUTOKITCH_COORDINATION\\worktrees\\claude-hat3-v8","sessionId":"f3ef876a-f062-4b29-bb81-775cc8a1a6d8","version":"2.1.286","gitBranch":"HEAD","slug":"crystalline-crunching-moonbeam"}
